{
  "$schema": "./contract.schema.json",
  "id": "antd.input",
  "name": "Input",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "status": "draft",
  "description": "Subject: antd@5.29.3 (pinned, examples/antd/PROVENANCE.md). CURATED seed for the antd P2 exam (code→canvas, held out) — props/axes only; anatomy is promoted from captured DOM truth. Every axis value is the library's own declared enum (antd spells them as `readonly [...]` tuples; seed-gen reads them once its declaration lookup ignores directory case — W1, examples/antd/RECON.md §4). ATOM WITH A ROOT-SWAP TRAP. Bare Input is ONE element (input.ant-input); prefix/suffix/addon/allowClear each REPLACE the root with span.ant-input-affix-wrapper > [prefix + input] (measured, RECON §2.6) — a presence prop that swaps the ROOT signature cannot factor (the Altitude href precedent), so they are NAMED OUT; an `InputAffix` subject with prefix pinned on is the honest spelling if wanted. `variant` is antd's FOUR-value tuple (underlined since 5.24, seed-gen read it); `bordered` is @deprecated (Input.d.ts:45) and not an axis. `status` is DEFAULTLESS (unset = no status). Focus is a box-shadow ring (carried channel), not an outline.",
  "semantics": {
    "element": "input"
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": {
        "enum": [
          "small",
          "middle",
          "large"
        ]
      },
      "default": "middle",
      "bindings": {
        "figma": {
          "kind": "VARIANT",
          "property": "Size",
          "values": {
            "small": "Small",
            "middle": "Middle",
            "large": "Large"
          }
        },
        "code": {
          "prop": "size"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "status",
      "type": {
        "enum": [
          "error",
          "warning"
        ]
      },
      "bindings": {
        "figma": {
          "kind": "VARIANT",
          "property": "Status",
          "values": {
            "error": "Error",
            "warning": "Warning"
          }
        },
        "code": {
          "prop": "status"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "variant",
      "type": {
        "enum": [
          "outlined",
          "borderless",
          "filled",
          "underlined"
        ]
      },
      "default": "outlined",
      "bindings": {
        "figma": {
          "kind": "VARIANT",
          "property": "Variant",
          "values": {
            "outlined": "Outlined",
            "borderless": "Borderless",
            "filled": "Filled",
            "underlined": "Underlined"
          }
        },
        "code": {
          "prop": "variant"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "disabled",
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false,
      "bindings": {
        "figma": {
          "kind": "BOOLEAN",
          "property": "Disabled"
        },
        "code": {
          "prop": "disabled"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "placeholder",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "Input",
      "bindings": {
        "figma": {
          "kind": "TEXT",
          "property": "Placeholder"
        },
        "code": {
          "prop": "placeholder"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "states": [
    "disabled",
    "focus-visible",
    "hover"
  ],
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {}
  },
  "bindings": {
    "figma": {
      "anchors": {
        "fileKey": null,
        "componentSetKey": null
      }
    },
    "code": {
      "anchors": {
        "importPath": "antd",
        "export": "Input"
      }
    }
  }
}
